<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket</p>
<p>standings after Monday's match (tabulate under played, won,</p>
<p>drawn, lost, points):</p>
<p> Queensland		3   3   0   0   18</p>
<p> Tasmania		  4   1   2   1    8</p>
<p> New South Wales	 3   1   1   1    7.8</p>
<p> Western Australia     2   1   0   1    6</p>
<p> Victoria		  4   1   1   2    5.7</p>
<p> South Australia	 2   0   0   2    0</p>
<p>Note: New South Wales penalised 0.2 points for slow over</p>
<p>rate in an earlier match against Tasmania, Victoria penalised</p>
<p>0.3 points for slow over rate in another previous match against</p>
<p>New South Wales.</p>
</text>
